# Build context is the repo root (infrastructure/docker-compose.yml) —
# without this, ~100MB+ of already-reinstalled dependencies and local-only
# files get uploaded to the Docker daemon on every build.
**/vendor
**/node_modules
**/writable/cache/*
**/writable/logs/*
**/writable/session/*
**/writable/debugbar/*
**/dist
**/.env
**/*.log
.git
